nk><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着投资者转向资产互换，德国债券避风港交易发生变化</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/german-bond-haven-trade-shifts-as-investors-turn-to-asset-swaps</link><description>投资者正在改变德国政府债券的交易方式，德国政府债券是欧洲在压力时期的首选避风港。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/german-bond-haven-trade-shifts-as-investors-turn-to-asset-swaps'&gt;随着投资者转向资产互换，德国债券避风港交易发生变化&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：German Bond Haven Trade Shifts as Investors Turn to Asset Swaps&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/german-bond-haven-trade-shifts-as-investors-turn-to-asset-swaps</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:52:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>南非 IDC 正在洽谈收购糖业公司 2.57 亿美元的股份</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/south-africa-s-idc-in-talks-for-257-million-stake-in-sugar-firm</link><description>南非最大的发展金融机构计划以 45 亿兰特（2.57 亿美元）的价格收购一家投资公司的股份，该公司正在寻求收购南非最大的甜味剂精炼商 Tongaat Hulett Sugar SA Ltd. 的股份。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/south-africa-s-idc-in-talks-for-257-million-stake-in-sugar-firm'&gt;南非 IDC 正在洽谈收购糖业公司 2.57 亿美元的股份&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：South Africa’s IDC in Talks for $257 Million Stake in Sugar Firm&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/south-africa-s-idc-in-talks-for-257-million-stake-in-sugar-firm</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:55:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>